 a year earlier than planned, in 2027 rather than 2028.","published":"2026-11-19T21:30:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534149/james-madison-moving-american-conference-2027","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 NFL draft Big Board rankings: Mel Kiper's top 25 prospects, best by position","description":"Six quarterbacks and six receivers ranked in the top 25? Mel Kiper Jr. stacks the best players on the 2027 draft board as of mid-November.","published":"2026-11-19T21:45:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft2027/story/_/id/50182998/2027-nfl-draft-rankings-kiper-big-board-top-prospects","type":"Story","byline":"Mel Kiper Jr.","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan WR Andrew Marsh facing misdemeanor indecent exposure charge","description":"Michigan receiver Andrew Marsh is facing a misdemeanor charge of indecent exposure stemming from a February incident involving a food service driver.","published":"2026-11-19T21:15:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50533990/michigan-wr-marsh-facing-misdemeanor-indecent-exposure-charge","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-19T21:22:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Hall of Famer Jack Ham returning to broadcast booth after health scare","description":"Hall of Fame linebacker and Penn State radio analyst Jack Ham will return to the broadcast booth on Saturday, just two weeks after suffering a medical emergency.","published":"2026-11-19T19:37:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532925/jack-ham-returning-broadcast-booth-health-scare","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 'College GameDay' Week 12: Virginia Tech vs. Miami","description":"\"College GameDay\" heads to University of Miami for Week 12.","published":"2026-11-19T19:27:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532540/2026-college-gameday-week-12-virginia-tech-vs-miami","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Studies: Blood test has potential to detect CTE in the living","description":"A new blood test shows potential to detect advanced stages of chronic traumatic encephalopathy (CTE) in the living, according to two recent published studies.","published":"2026-11-19T19:26:01.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50532686/studies-blood-test-potential-detect-cte-living","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Shwetha Surendran and Mark Fainaru-Wada","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What we learned about new NC State coach Philip Rivers in Fairhope, Alabama","description":"Rivers, the former NC State and NFL star quarterback, had been coaching high school football for six years.","published":"2026-11-19T12:19:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50514617/philip-rivers-nc-state-fairhope-alabama","type":"Story","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 Game Day Kickoff: Appreciating Jeremiah Smith's greatness","description":"What to expect in Week 12, from top games and players to teams on upset alert.","published":"2026-11-19T17:08:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedaykickoff111926/week-12-top-games-upsets-preview","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Inside the complexities of clock management in college football","description":"From Michigan-WMU to Notre Dame-BYU, the closing seconds of games seem to be more puzzling than ever.","published":"2026-11-19T12:17:18.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50522229/the-complexities-clock-management-college-football","type":"Story","byline":"Ryan McGee","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4922989/jelani-mcdonald","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jelani_McDonald"},"pick":{"pick":40,"round":2,"team":"IND","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jelani McDonald","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jelani_McDonald","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-17T20:11:56Z","intro":"Jelani McDonald is an American college football safety for the Texas Longhorns.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"McDonald attended Connally High School in Waco, Texas, where he played both defensive back and quarterback. As a senior, he was the Offensive MVP of District 11-4A Division 2 after rushing 77 times for 852 yards with nine touchdowns, and passing for 707 yards with 13 touchdowns. On defense he had 25 tackles, four sacks and an interception. McDonald was selected to play in the 2023 All-American Bowl. He committed to play college football at the University of Texas at Austin."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Texas in 2023, McDonald played in 12 games and had two tackles. As a sophomore in 2024, he played in 14 games with four starts and recorded 33 tackles and one interception.\nMcDonald became a starting safety his junior year in 2025. In the first four weeks of the 2025 season, McDonald contributed to three turnovers in three consecutive games, logging one fumble recovery for 24 yards against San Jose State, one interception for 16 yards against UTEP, and one interception against Sam Houston. He ended the season with 80 tackles, three interceptions, and one fumble recovery.\nFor the 2026 season, McDonald chose to return for his senior year and continued as the starting safety. In Week 11 against LSU, McDonald recorded three interceptions, becoming the first SEC player to record three interceptions in a single game since 2020. For his performance, McDonald was named Player of the Week by the Associated Press, Chuck Bednarik Award,  Jim Thorpe Award, and Walter Camp Award."}]}}